---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const stack = ['Feature scoring', 'Accuracy verification', 'Field intelligence'];
---

<Base
  title="Competitive Intelligence Matrix Case Study | Ishraq Alam"
  description="A living, accuracy-verified comparison of Nourish against 9+ care-sector competitors with a field-intelligence layer."
>
  <article class="case-study-detail">
    <!-- Ambient glows -->
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-1-csd"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-2-csd"></div>

    <section class="cs-hero relative">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <a href="/case-studies/" class="back">← All case studies</a>
        <span class="eyebrow animate-fade-in-up">Case study · Living document</span>
        <h1 class="animate-fade-in-up delay-1">Competitive Intelligence Matrix</h1>
        <p class="lede animate-fade-in-up delay-2">
          A living comparison of Nourish against 9+ care-sector competitors, including
          Roundsys, Birdie, Unique IQ, and PCS, built so every conversation about a
          competitor starts from verified facts, not folklore.
        </p>
        <ul class="chips animate-fade-in-up delay-3">
          {stack.map((item) => <li class="chip chip-blue">{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mockup-section relative">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="mockup animate-fade-in delay-4" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the Competitive Intelligence Matrix interface">
          <div class="mockup-titlebar">
            <span class="dot red"></span><span class="dot yellow"></span><span class="dot green"></span>
            <span class="mockup-title">competitive_intel_matrix.xlsx</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-body matrix-body">
            <div class="table-container">
              <table class="matrix-table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Core Care Feature</th>
                    <th class="active-col">Nourish Care</th>
                    <th>Competitor B (Birdie)</th>
                    <th>Competitor C (PCS)</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="feature-name">Offline Mode Execution</td>
                    <td class="check active-col">✓ Fully Offline</td>
                    <td class="cross">✗ Partial Sync</td>
                    <td class="cross">✗ Online Only</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="feature-name">Custom Care Templates</td>
                    <td class="check active-col">✓ Drag &amp; Drop</td>
                    <td class="check">✓ Standard Only</td>
                    <td class="cross">✗ Fixed Files</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="feature-name">CQC Data Pre-matching</td>
                    <td class="check active-col">✓ Automated API</td>
                    <td class="cross">✗ No Matching</td>
                    <td class="cross">✗ Manual Input</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pb-0 relative">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
        <h2>Two layers: verified truth and field signal</h2>
        <p class="text-body">
          The core is an accuracy-verified feature scoring matrix. Every claim about a
          competitor's product is checked before it goes in, so reps never repeat a
          myth to a prospect who knows better.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body">
          On top sits a <strong class="highlight-text">"Field Intelligence"</strong> layer: unverified feedback
          heard from prospects in live conversations. It's kept deliberately separate
          and labelled as signal, not fact, so the matrix captures what the market is
          saying without contaminating what we know to be true.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="relative">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why it matters</span>
        <h2>Competitive knowledge that compounds</h2>
        <p class="text-body">
          Most competitive intel lives in Slack threads and dies there. A living matrix
          means every prospect conversation makes the whole team sharper. It's the same
          system-building instinct behind the CQC dashboard, applied to knowledge
          instead of data.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="/case-studies/cqc-dashboard/" class="btn btn-ghost">Back to: CQC Research Dashboard →</a>
          <a href="/enterprise/" class="btn btn-primary">Work with me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .case-study-detail {
      background: var(--bg);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .glow-1-csd {
      width: 450px;
      height: 450px;
      background: var(--glow-1);
      right: -10%;
      top: 5%;
    }

    .glow-2-csd {
      width: 350px;
      height: 350px;
      background: var(--glow-2);
      left: -10%;
      bottom: 20%;
    }

    .relative {
      z-index: 1;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cs-hero { padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 32px; }

    .back {
      display: inline-flex;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .back:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .pb-0 { padding-bottom: 0; }

    .mockup-section { padding: 40px 0 0; }

    .mockup {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-premium);
      backdrop-filter: blur(var(--glass-blur));
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--glass-blur));
      transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .mockup:hover {
      transform: perspective(1000px) rotateX(2deg) rotateY(-2deg) translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-premium), var(--shadow-glow);
    }

    .mockup-titlebar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-raise);
    }

    .dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-right: 6px;
    }
    .dot.red { background: #ef4444; }
    .dot.yellow { background: #fbbf24; }
    .dot.green { background: #34d399; }

    .mockup-title {
      margin-left: 10px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .matrix-body {
      padding: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .table-container {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .matrix-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .matrix-table th,
    .matrix-table td {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .matrix-table th {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--bg-raise);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .matrix-table td.active-col,
    .matrix-table th.active-col {
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15);
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15);
    }

    .feature-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .matrix-table td.check {
      color: #10b981;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .matrix-table td.cross {
      color: #ef4444;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .text-body {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .highlight-text {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 36px;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
